    "function": "Proofreading amidase that contributes to the maintenance of cell wall composition and integrity (By similarity). It prevents the mis-incorporation of both L-serine and glycine containing precursors into the peptidoglycan (PG) sacculi (By similarity). Acts by hydrolyzing UDP-N-acetylmuramoyl-L-serine (UDP-MurNAc-L-Ser) to release L-serine and UDP-N-acetylmuramoyl-glycine (UDP-MurNAc-Gly) to release glycine, thereby preventing the mis-incorporation of these amino acids into the PG and ensuring that only the correct PG precursor, UDP-MurNAc-L-Ala, is incorporated (By similarity)..",
